  "title": "Cheeseburger Salad",
  "description": "This cheeseburger salad recipe has it all, including ground beef, lettuce, cheese, pickles, ketchup, mustard, and onion. Bun croutons are fun and tasty.",
  "authors": [
    "Kristina Bowling Briceno"
  ],
